<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -Silicon Storage Technology.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -Silicon Storage Technology.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist maintains buy rating on Silicon Storage Technology but urges caution until the overall pricing environment and visibility strengthens for flash memory.</p>
<p>-- Notes average selling prices of flash memory are beginning to weaken due to continued excess capacity in the industry.</p>
<p>-- Notes the PC Flash memory market is strong but business performance for the suppliers may be weak because unit growth will be diluted by weaker prices.</p>
</text>
